Modified distribution: Hippocampus's ArcticEmbedS_FP16.mlmodelc is a Core ML
FP16 conversion of the upstream model, not its original safetensors file.
The graph uses eager attention, a finite -10000 attention-mask floor, fixed
1x128 integer inputs, and a 1x384 float32 CLS-pooled, L2-normalized output.
It targets Core ML specification version 8 / macOS 14 or later. The compiled
graph, compiled metadata and FP16 weights are converted files;
hippocampus-model.json is added compatibility/provenance metadata.

